    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Learn more about Blackstone Valley Cannabis and what they offer! </strong></p><p>Blackstone Valley Cannabis was founded by local industry pioneers who believe in the power of cannabis to change lives. Their mission is simple: To create and spread goodness in everything we do and cultivate lasting relationships along the way.</p><p>They hold themselves to a higher standard than the status quo, which is why you’ll only find the freshest, highest-quality cannabis products.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/1cb35a4a-Blackston-Valley-Cannabis-Banner-Pop-Up-Event-1176x500-1.png\" alt=\"Blackstone Valley Cannabis at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"1176\" height=\"500\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Blackston-Valley-Cannabis-Banner-Pop-Up-Event-1176x500-1.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></p><p><a href=\"/brands/blackstone-valley-cannabis/\"><strong>Click here to shop Blackstone Valley Cannabis products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
